    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Run the identified controller with normal stress and with stress clamped to zero, then compare step-90 accuracy, red-cell survival, and later maintenance. The stated numerical contrast and failure of homeostasis are direct endpoints.";
